					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Microsoft Defender SmartScreen helps protect systems from programs downloaded from the internet that may be malicious. Enabling Microsoft Defender SmartScreen will warn or prevent users from running potentially malicious programs.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
