					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Windows 11 must be configured to prevent Windows apps from being activated by voice while the system is locked.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Allowing Windows apps to be activated by voice from the lock screen could allow for unauthorized use. Requiring logon will ensure the apps are only used by authorized personnel.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
