					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify that Audit Handle Manipulation auditing has been enabled: 

Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Windows Settings &gt;&gt; Security Settings &gt;&gt; Advanced Audit Policy Configuration &gt;&gt; System Audit Policies &gt;&gt; Object Access &gt;&gt; Audit Handle Manipulation. 

If "Audit Handle Manipulation" is not set to "Success", this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
